@startuml
skinparam actorStyle outline
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor "Student" as student
actor "Administrator" as admin

rectangle "Smart Campus Study Room Booking System" {
    usecase "View availability" as UC_View
    usecase "Book room" as UC_Book
    usecase "Cancel booking" as UC_Cancel
    usecase "Block/unblock room" as UC_Block
    usecase "Review usage" as UC_Usage

    student --> UC_View
    student --> UC_Book
    student --> UC_Cancel

    admin --> UC_Block
    admin --> UC_Usage
}

note right of UC_Book
    Successful booking produces
    a confirmation (R4).
end note

note bottom of UC_Book
    Assumptions:
    1. Students can view room availability
       before booking.
    2. Blocking a room prevents new bookings
       but does not cancel existing bookings.
    3. Students can cancel only their own bookings.
end note

@enduml